---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/sections/Hero.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import Card from '../components/ui/Card.astro';
import Heading from '../components/ui/Heading.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Geek Life Development | Websites and Business Applications"
  description="Geek Life Development helps small businesses in Ozaukee County, Milwaukee, Wisconsin, and remotely through professional websites and practical custom business applications."
>
  <Hero
    title="About Geek Life Development"
    subtitle="I help small businesses solve practical problems with technology — from professional websites that build trust and generate inquiries to custom business applications that simplify how work gets done behind the scenes."
    subtitleSecondary="The goal is not to add technology for the sake of it. It is to build something useful, understandable, and aligned with how your business actually works."
    primaryCta={{ label: 'Get a quote', href: '/contact' }}
    accent={false}
  />

  <Section class="!py-16 md:!py-20">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="What I build"
        title="Practical technology built around your business"
        subtitle="I build focused solutions that help businesses present themselves professionally, operate more efficiently, and keep improving over time."
      />
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-600">Serving Ozaukee County, the Milwaukee area, and remote clients.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Professional Websites</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Modern, business-focused websites designed to build credibility, explain what you do clearly, and make it easier for potential customers to take the next step.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Custom Business Applications</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Practical tools built around your business — from customer management and dashboards to workflows, forms, scheduling, and internal systems.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Ongoing support</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Reliable support for updates, improvements, troubleshooting, and keeping your website or business application useful as your needs change.</p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="muted" class="!py-16 md:!py-20">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="How I think about technology"
        title="The right solution is usually the simplest one that solves the problem well."
        subtitle="Small businesses do not always need another large software platform or a complicated technical system. Sometimes the right answer is a better website. Sometimes it is replacing a spreadsheet, connecting a few workflows, or building a focused internal tool around the way your team already works."
      />
      <Card hover={false}>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 md:text-base">
          My job is to understand the problem first and recommend an approach that makes sense for the business, budget, and people who will actually use it.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section class="!py-16 md:!py-20">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="How I work"
        title="Clear process, professional communication"
        subtitle="I keep projects organized so you know what is happening, what comes next, and what decisions need to be made."
      />
      <Card hover={false}>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li>• Clear scope before development begins</li>
          <li>• Straightforward communication and regular updates</li>
          <li>• Practical recommendations without unnecessary complexity</li>
          <li>• Realistic timelines with clear milestones</li>
          <li>• Testing and review before launch</li>
          <li>• Support and guidance after launch</li>
        </ul>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="muted" class="!py-14 md:!py-16">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Direct partnership"
        title="You work directly with the person building your project."
        subtitle="There is no sales handoff, account-manager layer, or separate development team to navigate. I handle the conversation, planning, development, and ongoing support, so the person understanding your business problem is also the person building the solution."
      />
      <Card hover={false}>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 md:text-base">
          I built Geek Life Development around a straightforward idea: small businesses should be able to get custom technology without navigating a large agency or forcing their business into software that does not quite fit.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700 md:text-base">
          I enjoy understanding how a business actually operates and turning those problems into practical, maintainable solutions.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700 md:text-base">
          That keeps communication clear, decisions faster, and projects more focused.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section class="!py-14 md:!py-16">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Who I work with"
        title="A practical technology partner for local and remote businesses"
        subtitle="I work with small businesses and organizations that want clear communication, dependable delivery, and technology that solves a real business need."
      />
      <Card hover={false}>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 md:text-base">
          That may be a new website, a better way to manage information, a custom workflow, or a combination of the two.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">
          Serving Ozaukee County, the Milwaukee area, and remote clients.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="muted" class="!py-14 md:!py-16">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <Heading
        eyebrow="Portfolio context"
        title="Not every project belongs in a public portfolio"
        subtitle="Some business applications I've worked on involve private internal processes, customer information, or operational data and cannot be shown publicly."
      />
      <Card hover={false}>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 md:text-base">
          I can still discuss the types of problems I've worked on, the approach I take, and how I design practical software without exposing private business information.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="dark">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-white">Have a website to build — or a business problem technology could solve?</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-slate-300">Tell me what you're trying to accomplish. I'll help you figure out a practical next step.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <Button href="/contact" size="lg">Get a quote</Button>
        <Button href="/services" size="lg" variant="secondary">View services</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>